    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4908" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bambycē</span></b> ,
		ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βαμβύκη</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in Cœlosyria</i>, <i>also called</i> Hieropolis, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 23,
				19, § 81</span></i>.—Hence, adj.:
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bambycius</span></b> ,
